Description:
With over 25 years of practical experience installing everything from home theatre to complex commercial AV setups, our founder at Avison knew that he could deliver a specialised service to people in the Sydney metropolitan area.

Avision was conceived in 2012 with the purpose of providing a complete service in AV and related merchandise. We don’t just install high-end Audio Visual products, we offer an all in one design, supply, install and support solution that takes the headache out of sourcing compatible products. You tell us what you need and we do the rest.
We are a fully Australian owned business and we take pride in supplying a professional, on time service to all of our customers. 

Our technical crew hold the required certifications and licences for safe installation to protect your home or workplace and we back this up with a 12 month Service Warranty – products are covered by the manufacturer’s warranty.

SERVICES WE OFFER

At AVsion we offer services for all residential and workplace environments and can design the perfect solution to suit your requirements. 

We can provide Samsung LED TV’s, Denon and Marantz receivers, Cambridge, PSB and Mission speakers, Niles for custom design projects and more.

Our services include:

    TV wall mounting installation;
    Home cinema/theater installation;
    Multi room music;
    Home automation – design, supply & install;
    CCTV installation;
    Telecommunication cabling for all audio, video and data;
    Intercom installation
    Commercial AV installation for meeting/board rooms;
    Remote control programming.

At Avision we come to you. We can evaluate the equipment that you already own, talk to you about what you need and provide you with a comprehensive solution to fit your budget and complement your space.

If the service you are looking for isn’t listed here, please contact us. We provide many custom solutions and we are confident we can do the same for you.

Communications Consulting Group (Australia) comprises professional members who have all worked together at some time during their extensive careers and are now working together as independent consultants providing work for each other and working together to offer turnkey solutions, consulting support and training to the telecommunications and communications industries. 

CCG Australia offers the following services to its clients:

- Consulting individually or as a team to Telecommunications Service Providers & Utilities, Communications Equipment Suppliers and Government Departments on network architectures, network design, communications product design, network modelling and cost/benefit analysis;

- Supporting Universities and Start-ups to commercialise their technologies by drawing on our own Start-up and broader commercial experience;

- Supporting new entrants to the NBN Industry in Australia through high level and focused training courses, with target audiences including:
 * Final year tertiary students & post-graduates wanting to start their career working on the NBN; 
 * Graduates aiming to work on the NBN in one of the many NBN related companies; and 
 * Project managers needing to get up to speed on the NBN technology areas in which they will be working.
